    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your clan is tied to the moon Therendor - The Healer's Moon.</p>\n<p>You become trained in Medicine (or another skill if you were already trained in Medicine), and you gain the @Compendium[pf2e.feats-srd.wYerMk6F1RZb0Fwt]{Battle Medicine} skill feat. In addition, when you roll a medicine check to Administer First Aid a critical failure becomes a failure, and a failure becomes a success. </p>"
